Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:03.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.01,0:00:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,除去血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting rid of the mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放了一股能摧毁一切的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}unleashed a force on this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定是黑暗干的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the darkness, right? It's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一来 大家就变疯狂僵尸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She shows up and everybody goes "28 days later"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,像一群疯狗一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were like rabid dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.31,0:00:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不肯停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是烟的关系 所有暴露在外的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was the smoke, and anybody who was outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就受到了影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何不可 我刚杀了死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? I killed death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在什么都能接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty much open for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.49,0:00:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们把血滴在你身上了吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did they bleed on you? - They did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是会传染的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be transmittable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You save my baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.39,0:00:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的名字是阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以等着他们死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can just wait for them to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们困在医院里可救不了小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't save Cass if we're stuck in some hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们 别让我做出更可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers… save me from doing worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 拿上装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's gear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,救人意味着要救所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people means all of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.09,0:00:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,带珍娜和孩子去个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Jenna and the baby somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枪不发地做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能行吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, you good? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.84,0:01:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要送珍娜去她祖母家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna run Jenna up to her grandmother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样我都会找到解药的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not, I'm gonna find a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:18.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:23.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（内布拉斯加 苏佩里尔）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-a-t-e.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,长兄该隐用这只左手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was with this left hand that old brother Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死了他的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}struck the blow that laid his brother low.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.29,0:02:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}L-o-v-e.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这手指了吗 都弯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see these fingers? They're arched.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这手指的血管穿透了人的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}These fingers has veins that run straight to the soul of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.35,0:02:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,右手 朋友们 是爱之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The right hand, friends… the hand of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 我将给你们展现生命的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now watch, and I'll show you the story of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些手指 各位 总是有摩擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}These fingers, dear hearts, is always a-warrin' and a-tuggin',
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,打个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}one against the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.42,0:02:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now watch 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,左手老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old brother left hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,左手讨厌争斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}left hand hates a-fightin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.55,0:02:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来已经没有感情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it looks like love's a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是已经救不回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you too far gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.27,0:02:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 爱赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, siree. It's love that won.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,左手老哥的仇恨被击败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And old left-hand hate is down for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,答得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第11季第2集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.24,0:03:18.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱荷华州 锡达拉皮兹市）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一片不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nice neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我差不多是在这儿长大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I pretty much grew up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在街角那边学会的骑自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learned to ride my bike down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,初吻是在那边那栋蓝色的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had my first kiss at that blue house over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.23,0:03:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边破的处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost my virginity up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝房那个肯定很不高兴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet blue house was pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮下忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,小美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.47,0:03:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才叫你带我们来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I asked you to bring us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:04:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了那么多事 这里感觉很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything that happened, it just feels safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 有安全感很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good, safe is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真会带她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so great with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法 女人都喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what can I say, chicks dig me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.43,0:04:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, I should…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be okay, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和萨姆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you and Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会有事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩对没事的标准很低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for us, the bar's pretty low.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍娜 - 奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jenna. - Hi, grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打电话来后 新闻里做了大幅报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you called, they did a big report on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个我讨厌的龅牙天气预报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}That weatherman I don't like with the big teeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说苏佩里尔遭遇了奇怪风暴的袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said some kind of freak storm hit Superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真是疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It was…Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别担心 风暴要是过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't you worry. If that thing rolls our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这儿有发电机 还有足够的罐装豆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a generator and enough canned green beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,能坚持到审判日呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}to last till judgment day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.11,0:05:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是阿玛拉了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this must be Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a little angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 她是个奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. She's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她父母呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那等你睡醒了再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then it can wait till after your nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.37,0:05:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.97,0:05:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多久没合眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time you slept?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 我这话可是完全出于好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because… and I mean this is the nicest possible way…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.55,0:05:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你样子真是糟糕透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like poop on parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把客卧收拾好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I made up the guest bedroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还把你爸以前的婴儿床搬出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got your father's old crib out for the baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.11,0:05:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抱她去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I will put her down…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I will…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上楼去休息一会儿 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you go upstairs and have a rest, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.61,0:05:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 能睡一觉真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, a nap sounds awesome right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你赶紧上楼去吧 小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, you just go right upstairs, missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.26,0:06:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是个小天使啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the little angel, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.35,0:06:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也得睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是个漂亮的宝宝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, who's a beautiful baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你漂亮 你最漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a beautiful, beautiful baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡觉吧 小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night-night, doodlebug.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.43,0:06:37.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（婴儿物品）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.97,0:07:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.11,0:07:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, "Bite me, "
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受感染多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how long have you been infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想问你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能闻出自己人的味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We smell our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.89,0:07:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道自己还剩多少时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you want to know how much time you got left?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:07:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.29,0:08:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能找到解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I can find a cure…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.39,0:08:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要点切实的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want something real…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看得见摸得着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…something I can hold in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.03,0:08:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚被感染的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was infected last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.05,0:08:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早\N{\fnArial\fs30}This morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Then why…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.95,0:08:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你更严重吗 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…am I further along? Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西 又不是数学那么精准\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing, it ain't math.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:09:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见有些人转化得很快 有些人很慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seen some people change fast, some change slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最终\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the end…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的结果都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all end up the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.93,0:09:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we go boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.11,0:09:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是在慢慢死掉而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just taking our sweet time about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你聪明 就一枪崩了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you were smart, you'd put a bullet in me…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把自己也解脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then eat one yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,接啊 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dean."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.35,0:10:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do the honors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃弗拉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Efram.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,约拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么…怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's… what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有问题问你 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have questions for you, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求助来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还求一副没有牛皮癣的皮囊呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I asked for a vessel that didn't have psoriasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒霉事年年有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.91,0:10:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不明白 我被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. I'm cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.73,0:11:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是浣熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounded like raccoon…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.51,0:11:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不是浣熊的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not a raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:40.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（喂）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:46.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:56.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（喂我）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.66,0:12:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母啊 珍娜 别过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Mary, mother… no, Jenna, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.03,0:12:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 别 那女孩身体里有魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna, no! The devil's in that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.81,0:12:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打给怀亚特神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling father Wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandma, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们还能打给谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who are we gonna call?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉鬼队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghostbusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:41.02,Title,0,0,0,0,,听起来像《驱魔人》里的桥段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it sounds like something out of "The exorcist."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you thinking demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者孩子被什么感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or kid got infected by something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道之前那股龙卷屁里有什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, who knows what was in that giant, crazy fart?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好生动 多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vivid. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你现在是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I know you're flying solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.34,0:12:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没事 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm… I'm fine, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, don't… don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:13:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助珍娜去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… just help Jenna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you need anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.53,0:13:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}then call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.81,0:13:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样了 僵尸之地怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing? How's "Zombieland"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.23,0:13:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.82,0:13:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.98,0:13:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆在哪 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Metatron, Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶了我吧 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercy, brother, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.72,0:13:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.17,0:13:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是上帝的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.63,0:13:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 就我看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, near as I can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每次在天堂和温家兄弟间做选择时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you have to choose between heaven and the Winchesters…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都会选他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you choose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.32,0:13:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:14:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你才不是我兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, see, you're not my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要我说了算 我会拿这把利刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I had it my way, I'd take this blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.23,0:14:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,插进你的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}stick it in your heart…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当这一天很完美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and call that a damn good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.65,0:14:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好玩的才刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fun's just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:38.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（传染病）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 死亡啊 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ O death. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 死亡啊 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ O death. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 死亡啊 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ O death. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:15:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你不再给我一年时间吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Won't you spare me over another year? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.72,0:15:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我看不到的这是什么 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, what is this that I can't see. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 冰冷的手擒住了我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ With ice-cold hands taking hold of me? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.21,0:15:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 当上帝已去 魔鬼掌权 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When God is gone and the devil takes hold. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 谁将宽恕你的灵魂 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Who'll have mercy on your soul? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.99,0:15:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.18,0:15:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想问 「什么」吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you mean "What?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你个提示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你哥哥 最近让我们生意兴隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your brother been real good for business lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The circle gets the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:15:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在跟我调情吗 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, you flirtin' with me, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.57,0:16:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别介意 但你不是我喜欢的型\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, no offense, but you ain't my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想亲近\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not looking to get friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮忙宰了我老板的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the man who helped gut my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,死骑的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有人在死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But people are still dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我得做我的工作 收集灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}so…work to do, souls to collect…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,传递消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Messages to deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of messages?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.15,0:16:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,反反复复地死去活来\N{\fnArial\fs30}dying and coming back again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前的死骑觉得这挺好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old Death thought it was funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.39,0:16:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 这世界只有一条铁律\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now there's one hard, fast rule in this universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,生者皆有一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}What lives…dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你和你哥哥下次再死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the next time you or your brother bite it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是别想上天堂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, you're not going to heaven…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.17,0:17:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也别想下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}or hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.14,0:17:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中的一个 真希望是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of us… and, lord, I hope it's me…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,会犯个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna make a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们丢进虚无\N{\fnArial\fs30}and toss you out into the empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是回不来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing comes back from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:37.93,Title,0,0,0,0,,你不洁 《圣经》意义上的不洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're unclean in the Biblical sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.52,0:17:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回见了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll be seeing you again, Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久就能再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing you real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我叫比莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Billie, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,再问一遍 梅塔特隆在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again, Metatron… where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.36,0:18:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你把他劫出了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you broke him out of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 还抢了他的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - And took his grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.03,0:18:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.75,0:18:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还指望我们相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you expect us to believe he, what,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没了法力和翅膀 还能从你手下逃脱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}just gave you the slip… no powers, no wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆耍了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你就是蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.78,0:18:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.53,0:18:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个办法能一探究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.65,0:18:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先割下哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should we cut off first?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.41,0:18:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eeny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meeny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.09,0:18:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or moe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:18:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.90,0:19:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,审问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不这么做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't how we do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't thank me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事了 卡西迪奥 可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's happened, Castiel… something horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.80,0:19:56.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（礼拜堂）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我很久没祈祷了 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's been a long time, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.01,0:20:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩和我 我们经历了很多坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean and I, we've… we've been through a lot of bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次是我的错 我不知道该怎么补救\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my fault, and I don't know how to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.17,0:20:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I have to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我早已接受 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made my peace with that, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.35,0:20:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩命不该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean deserves better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩该活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean deserves a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有人 好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are people out there, good people,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.55,0:21:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因我而蒙受折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are going to suffer because of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在求你替我收拾烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am not asking you to clean up my mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道你是不是还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I don't even know if you're out there, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你在\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you are…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能听到我 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you can hear me, I, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.68,0:21:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要帮助 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need your help, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要知道希望尚存\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to know there's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.01,0:21:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要个启示\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.70,0:22:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.23,0:22:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.71,0:22:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又有新问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got another problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.58,0:22:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.67,0:22:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想阻止她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to stop her,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.66,0:22:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我奶奶是虔诚的天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my grandma's real Catholic,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.36,0:22:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生那事后 她叫来了神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}and after the crazy, she called her priest,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.07,0:22:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父派来了一位驱魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who sent over an exorcist.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.55,0:22:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.57,0:22:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.99,0:22:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.35,0:23:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.71,0:23:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是克劳力神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.88,0:23:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认识吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.71,0:23:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩当年是个很可爱的祭台助手呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean was a rather scrumptious young altar boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.12,0:23:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能出去谈谈吗 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you outside…father?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.33,0:23:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先喝个茶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I finish my tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.61,0:23:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.40,0:23:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆的事我没撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't lying about Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.35,0:23:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.45,0:24:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 我更担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now, I'm more worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能治好我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you heal me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.78,0:24:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.07,0:24:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.10,0:24:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这法术十分强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}This… it's…powerful magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.49,0:24:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 克劳力神父 你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Father Crowley? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.81,0:24:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 上了年纪的可怜虫过气摇滚明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, aging, pathetic, has-been rock star.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.48,0:24:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是触犯到你敏感的情绪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I offend your delicate sensibilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.32,0:24:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.35,0:24:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟和那个白痴天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother and that idiot angel,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.18,0:24:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们最近在捣鼓什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you know what they've been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.19,0:24:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.08,0:24:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.86,0:24:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听了不少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.80,0:24:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.24,0:24:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样 查案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as you… I'm working the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.61,0:24:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到咒语陷得越来越深\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel the spell just cutting deeper and deeper,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.03,0:24:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm trying to fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.99,0:24:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力抵抗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.26,0:24:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟内布拉斯加州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it have anything to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.03,0:24:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏佩里尔的骚动有关吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the disturbance in Superior, Nebraska?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.41,0:24:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.27,0:24:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂的警报大作 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alarms have been sounding in heaven, Castiel…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.18,0:25:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这警报从来没响过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alarms that haven't gone off in…ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.40,0:25:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know what they mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.03,0:25:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是为黑暗准备的警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those alarms are for the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.15,0:25:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗只是个传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness is a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.03,0:25:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not. It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.74,0:25:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.85,0:25:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从创世之处就被锁起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been locked away since the dawn of creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.81,0:25:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在它被释放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.82,0:25:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是出什么问题了 迪恩都会解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's wrong, Dean will fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.42,0:25:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.95,0:25:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别指望他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't count on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.57,0:25:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.93,0:25:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.88,0:25:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.54,0:25:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁知道 温家兄弟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who would? The Winchesters?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.77,0:26:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 如果这是真的 那我们都完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, if this is true, it's the end for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.66,0:26:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩 他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean… where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.17,0:26:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.06,0:26:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then think harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.62,0:26:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.68,0:26:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在天主教会有眼线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have sources in the Catholic church…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.97,0:26:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,欠我人情的修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuns that owe me a favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.32,0:26:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些癖好的神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}priests with a taste for…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.77,0:26:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 嗯 我想象得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right, yeah, I can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.60,0:26:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真心想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.04,0:26:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 他们听说有恶魔附体 就找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhow, they hear of a demonic possession, they call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.04,0:26:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是我的人 我就叫他们别管\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's one of mine, I tell them to ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.78,0:26:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是乱来的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's a, uh, demon gone rogue,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.12,0:26:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那克劳力神父就要出场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, that's when father Crowley comes out to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.37,0:26:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你觉得里面是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think there's a demon in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.62,0:26:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.19,0:27:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.00,0:27:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't think you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.63,0:27:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.91,0:27:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你叫埃弗拉姆和约拿把我带来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you told Efram and Jonah to bring me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.99,0:27:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to hurt me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.24,0:27:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让你能\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so you arranged to… to…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.24,0:27:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯进来救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to burst in and save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.23,0:27:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望我会感激你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were hoping that I would be so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.04,0:27:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你言听计从\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would do anything you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.38,0:27:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你知无不言\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would tell you anything that you wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.36,0:27:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Hannah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.22,0:27:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.55,0:27:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你放走梅塔特隆之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was before you freed Metatron…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.49,0:27:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.85,0:27:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他天使 他们恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other angels, they hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.59,0:27:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢 你也恨我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about you? Do you hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.59,0:28:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.40,0:28:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们投了票 民主决议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took a vote… democracy in action…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.34,0:28:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉娜必须服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}and… Hannah's doing the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.95,0:28:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会把萨姆和迪恩供出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't give you Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.21,0:28:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.00,0:28:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要入侵你的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna hack your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.38,0:28:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那房子里的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's in that house,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.22,0:28:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能嗅到它辐射出来的法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can taste the power radiating from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.92,0:28:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jenna!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.09,0:28:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.10,0:28:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.17,0:28:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它很古老\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's old…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.23,0:28:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在楼上掉了一颗保龄球吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you do, drop a bowling ball up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.54,0:28:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很深\N{\fnArial\fs30}…deep…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.38,0:28:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.70,0:28:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.38,0:28:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.58,0:29:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想试试这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wanted to try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.07,0:29:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.29,0:29:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.72,0:29:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呦 出现转折了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello, plot twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.67,0:29:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.45,0:29:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.77,0:29:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你知道怎么干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you knew how to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.79,0:29:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看娜奥米做过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched Naomi… once.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.49,0:29:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.51,0:29:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你不想脏了自己的手 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you don't want to get your pretty hands dirty, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.85,0:29:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就走吧 但这事势在必行 给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk away. But this is happening. Gimme.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.40,0:29:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.22,0:29:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下要疼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one might hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.84,0:29:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.33,0:29:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再敢拦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get in my way again…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.54,0:29:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再敢碰我 看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You touch me again, and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.31,0:30:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.11,0:30:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…end you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.65,0:30:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃弗拉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Efram.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.77,0:30:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.14,0:30:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.00,0:31:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.83,0:31:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.87,0:31:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Sam, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.42,0:31:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.96,0:31:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事 你没事 你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fine, you're fine, you're fine, you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.47,0:31:44.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,你不洁 《圣经》意义上的不洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're unclean in the biblical sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.40,0:31:59.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣经净化）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.68,0:32:00.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（净化）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.77,0:32:02.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣经净化 马克福音9：49）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.62,0:32:05.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（必须用火来净化 如同献祭）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.10,0:32:10.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣油）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.97,0:32:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.42,0:32:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么对你自己 别这么对你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this to yourself. Don't do this to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.54,0:32:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.56,0:32:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.39,0:32:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.30,0:32:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么对你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.30,0:32:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.49,0:33:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jen!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.72,0:33:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.77,0:33:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.00,0:33:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.97,0:33:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全不晓得所面对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no idea what.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.65,0:33:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是哪路惊天地泣鬼神的邪恶始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}ancient, world-shattering evil we're dealing with,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.59,0:33:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.71,0:33:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,大喊大叫让他知道我们要来了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him know we're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.97,0:33:33.79,Title,0,0,0,0,,听好 维尔玛（动画《史酷比》中的女孩） 咱们又不是史酷比帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Velma, this isn't the Scooby Gang, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.79,0:33:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要么闭嘴要么滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either shut up or get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.32,0:33:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动气 小老虎 我就是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, tiger. Just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.15,0:33:43.04,Title,0,0,0,0,,人家更像达芙妮（动画《史酷比》中的女孩）哎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm way more of a Daphne.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.39,0:34:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是联系在一起的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bound, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.57,0:34:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会永远联系在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll always be bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.48,0:34:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远都会帮助彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will always help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.65,0:34:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The child likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.77,0:34:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不意外呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No surprise, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.75,0:34:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你充满了母性光辉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very maternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.59,0:34:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find Jenna.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.57,0:34:37.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纳克尔斯郡医疗中心）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.31,0:35:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.37,0:35:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.41,0:35:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去救其他人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go save the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.85,0:36:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗血啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.45,0:36:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.62,0:36:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.68,0:36:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是我奶奶的收藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandma collected these things,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.90,0:36:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我一直觉得这些东西都挺…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I always thought they were so…blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.49,0:36:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 她不介意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. She won't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.54,0:36:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她的喉咙割破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cut her throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.26,0:36:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.45,0:36:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这个女人没有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this woman doesn't have a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.68,0:36:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.17,0:36:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么 这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.70,0:36:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.62,0:36:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她正在长身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a growing girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.57,0:37:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.36,0:37:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论发生了什么 无论怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's happened, whatever's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.86,0:37:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都能解决好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can fix it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.12,0:37:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不想解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't want to be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.74,0:37:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个崭新的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the new me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.28,0:37:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她挺有个性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.24,0:37:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们走 好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come with us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.47,0:37:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.19,0:37:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was getting bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.92,0:37:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.63,0:37:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.06,0:37:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.19,0:37:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看那个吃灵魂的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see the child that eats souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.03,0:38:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白那是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get what that thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.50,0:38:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enlighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.85,0:38:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 别欲擒故纵嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, darling. Don't play coy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.61,0:38:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉应该就是黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Amara is the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.44,0:38:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.15,0:38:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.43,0:38:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去杀了她吗 你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill her? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.28,0:38:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.73,0:38:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.81,0:38:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你可以杀婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you could murder a baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.14,0:38:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也杀不了那个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}you couldn't murder that baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.97,0:38:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你看她的样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the way you looked at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.60,0:38:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.07,0:38:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又不是我第一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not like it'd be my first.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.67,0:38:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是主动提供帮助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is that an offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.80,0:38:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个承诺 等我解决了她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a promise … right after I'm done with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.22,0:38:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.94,0:38:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.40,0:38:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱的小迪恩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adorable little Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.74,0:38:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要那个孩子 而我总能如愿以偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that child, and I get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.87,0:38:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和萨姆不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Sam don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.31,0:38:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你们的小跟班\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your bloody sidekick!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.72,0:39:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们共度过一些美好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had some good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.79,0:39:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要给你一次机会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna give you one chance …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.00,0:39:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一次…走出那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one … to walk out that door,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.78,0:39:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就把你一点点分解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'm gonna take you apart atom by atom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.22,0:39:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understa…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.61,0:39:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.97,0:40:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我还是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}All right, I still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.11,0:40:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为黑暗是个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I thought the darkness was a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.58,0:40:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.47,0:40:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么以为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.53,0:40:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许我之前看到的不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe whatever I saw wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.53,0:40:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只是个幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was a vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.59,0:40:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vision?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.51,0:40:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.09,0:40:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.17,0:40:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 奇怪里面最最奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, weird with a weird cherry on a weird top.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.25,0:40:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找个女佣\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.70,0:40:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那种 穿着紧身制服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, one with a-a little uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.52,0:40:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有大…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and really big, uh …
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.40,0:41:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.37,0:41:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 瞧瞧你长成了这么个小可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, haven't you grown into a sweet young thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.99,0:41:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃糖吗 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want some candy, little girl?
